# The built web demo bundle under web_demo/ is committed verbatim and served
# directly by GitHub Pages. Git's default text normalisation (CRLF on Windows)
# would corrupt the binary artefacts — notably the CanvasKit .wasm files, which
# are loaded as raw bytes by the browser.
#
# Mark everything in the published bundle as binary so it is stored and checked
# out byte-for-byte, whatever platform the commit or the checkout happens on.
web_demo/** -text -diff

# Be explicit about the ones that would break most visibly, for clarity.
web_demo/canvaskit/*.wasm binary
web_demo/canvaskit/*.js binary
web_demo/*.js binary
web_demo/assets/** binary
